endent."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/score","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Score"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Score"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/Score"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOpus/Item":{"title":"MXLOpus.Item","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One of the alternatives for Opus."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus\/item","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Item"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Item"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus\/Item"}}}